-- Agreed tests (verification step 2, plain SQL on PostgreSQL) for WideWorldImporters Integration.GetTransactionUpdates.
-- GENERATED by npm run agreed-tests -- --object Integration.GetTransactionUpdates. Do not edit by hand: change the fixed cases
